,"source":"bangumi","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"退役軍人。二本の魔剣を巡る争奪戦に巻き込まれ、その一本である【碧の賢帝】を継承してしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"リィンバウムの夜の浜辺で、アズリアと共にイスラのことを話している時に突然召喚される。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その際に謎の影を見ている。繭世界に召喚されるとアズリアの姿はなく、移動中にレオルドと出会い共に行動することに。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"兇乱したバノッサとの戦いに苦戦するアムたちに助っ人として加勢する。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"39884"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/db/dbd0cf6fabf8986376f91e572ab8d9a11521642bcf9d264571a77bc251d79310.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7b/7b53b04abe8a223c9c2d01b9c7b8eb9829daa6da37f5cde3930d8705fad7394b.webp","width":256,"height":214,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"櫻井孝宏","creatorId":"vndb:s50","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s50","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s50","name":"櫻井 孝宏","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:47558:39884:4015:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_39888","characterName":"アルカ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"39888","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"47558"}]},"originalCharacterName":"アルカ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"主角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"響友カゲロウと共に異世界調停機構ユクロスに所属する調停召喚師。【真紅の鎖】の暗躍に端を発する冥土にまつわる騒動に関わる。事件終息後、カゲロウと共にライル機関に出向し、再度の冥土の脅威に備えるための研究に協力していた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"未知の世界を探索中、偶然にも壊人エルストの姿を発見してしまう。救えなかった憧れの人を今度こそ助けたいと願い、カゲロウと共に壊人エルストを追う。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"39888"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/6c/6c4103c872f0a19c55a06d8fe0eb991844135f095354c3d549610e8b89698712.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/33/33e2246586f84f88d9e1910e80271950c0821b0d7da1d24206722e5f60a618c0.webp","width":159,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"遠藤綾","creatorId":"vndb:s5699","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s5699","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s5699","name":"遠藤 綾","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:47558:39888:4893:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_39903","characterName":"ペリエ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"39903","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"47558"}]},"originalCharacterName":"ペリエ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"フォルスの響友。共に異世界調停機構ユクロスに所属している。フォルスのお手伝いをしていた所、店内にいたトルクと共に召喚される。フォルスに従って状況を把握すべく動こうとしたその矢先、イストと接触。召喚の影響で体力が衰えているため、単体での戦闘力が著しく低下している。 それでもおにいちゃんの助けになるべく懸命にがんばる。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"39903"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1c/1c98694d3f589c1f8993b5ebeb3ae499b3296dc5f0dfd25bfd90fb316de48678.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e2/e2b9627c5b1fdbd153e1a67298909091d1ab7cca7ad1e99973fb67721641a84c.webp","width":211,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"本多真梨子","creatorId":"vndb:s5178","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s5178","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s5178","name":"本多真梨子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:47558:39903:5203:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_39904","characterName":"トルク","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"39904","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"47558"}]},"originalCharacterName":"トルク","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"若き天才鍛冶師。魔剣の秘密に迫るためセイヴァールにやってきた。フォルスのコーヒーを飲んでくつろいでいた所、近くにいたフォルスやペリエと共に召喚される。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"召喚の影響で体力が衰えているため、居住空間にとどまる事が多い。そのためヒマを持て余し、どこからか出現する壊れた武器をなんとなく修復している。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"39904"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8e/8e5cb3a38f0f3795990cefd4ca1ce0cac4ee5d978ecdaf48a323929e91b537ea.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b2/b263785da416575f9af4c030329a33900b82f14ab2feee6a241de43fb4a5c33c.webp","width":223,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"真田アサミ","creatorId":"vndb:s1712","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1712","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1712","name":"真田 アサミ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:47558:39904:3847:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_39906","characterName":"ルチル","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"39906","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"47558"}]},"originalCharacterName":"ルチル","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"神出鬼没の悪魔商人。界を自在に転移する希有な能力をもっているが戦闘力は皆無。商売仲間であるメイメイの遺言で『観測者』の役目を引き継いでいる。当人は移動中に突如繭世界に引っ張り込まれたというがその真偽は不明。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"元は『サモンナイトエクステーゼ』のキャラクターだが、『4』にも登場しているため、便宜上ここに記す。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"39906"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/29/290598eb5e4d1ab8ee2070353fbdf6a4fc258e4fcc802f88ed7196f80a5b21e2.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5b/5b862d3128f25103df2ed5467a0886c7e52ebee01253c9997b1cf948bcf56f09.webp","width":256,"height":228,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"中原麻衣","creatorId":"vndb:s444","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s444","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s444","name":"中原 麻衣","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:47558:39906:4145:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_39908","characterName":"ラディリア","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"39908","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"47558"}]},"originalCharacterName":"ラディリア","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"『響融化（アストレイズ）』後のリィンバウム出身。調停召喚師の組織『異世界調停機構ユクロス』のシステム管理官として、マザー（未来のクノン）によって創造された。ユクロスのメンバーからは「管理官さん」と呼ばれる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"フォルス、ペリエの追想システムによる訓練中、まとめて召喚されてしまった。単独でこの世界を探査中、コーラルと出会い行動を共にするが、イオスが率いる軍団に見つかって捕縛されかける。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"39908"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9e/9ef6e9096451f5f39ef73039545d783df8cbccdd8e1303344f284da9f6dd4807.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/44/44a1c02ac7a004019b018156e697326aa24889b49caf8ef5d1ab5b7110a11ec6.webp","width":226,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"堀江由衣","creatorId":"vndb:s46","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s46","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s46","name":"堀江 由衣","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:47558:39908:3970:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_39912","characterName":"スピネル","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"39912","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"47558"}]},"originalCharacterName":"スピネル","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"アルカ（別時間軸）の響友。彼女を姉さまと呼んでべったりだった。ユクロスに用事で出かけた彼女を迎えに行く途中、召喚されてしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"召喚時の記憶はなし。召喚された事で魔力が減衰し、満足に「奇跡」が使えない。予期せぬ事態に狼狽し、不安で泣きそうになっていたところをアズリアに救われる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"以来、彼女を「お姉さま」と呼んで慕い、行動を共にしてきた。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"39912"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e2/e2806814dc6ff838f26057c89206fccafad9c69bd1e48068db5e4d5ee8a51f74.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e1/e18840e8d403fe8b607697996de97fa16e6821e319f7d724f7e98657ad6fa40c.webp","width":224,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"阿澄佳奈","creatorId":"vndb:s1189","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1189","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1189","name":"阿澄 佳奈","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:47558:39912:4868:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_39915","characterName":"壞人エルスト","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"39915","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"47558"}]},"originalCharacterName":"壞人エルスト","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"響友ガウディと共に異世界調停機構ユクロスに所属していた俊英の調停召喚師。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"妄執で歪んだ弟のギフトによって冥土を植えつけられ冥土壊人へとなり果ててしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自我が曖昧な状態のまま召喚されたため、制御ができぬ状態となって暴走。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"周囲に冥土をまき散らして彷徨うイリーガルな存在と化す。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"39915"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/59/5970bd0afd4b4d821d05501d6969bd8a62f528f45b16ab391ab310265c7b0ee0.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/31/3171b2d15d2a356b7920511855986fadeca2cf0e1fe7a7f6ccba3249b021d243.webp","width":256,"height":187,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"杉田智和","creatorId":"vndb:s370","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s370","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s370","name":"杉田 智和","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:47558:39915:4513:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_39916","characterName":"カゲロウ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"39916","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"47558"}]},"originalCharacterName":"カゲロウ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"アルカの響友。共に異世界調停機構ユクロスに所属する。『冥土』にまつわる騒動に関わり、その過程で自分が界の狭間にたゆたう冥土の天敵、浄化の光から生じた新生命だと知る。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"事件終息後、アルカと共にライル機関に出向し、研究に協力していた。久々の休日、アルカと共に買い物に出かけたところを召喚される。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"39916"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7d/7d851e234e0810b93d126d6f184ed03379788fdbf2567bbd82c185f596353bd7.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/64/64222f7c433e61790bec99b673de4a8d71238df8e5d8907977d05c629e87c49d.webp","width":256,"height":193,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"柿原徹也","creatorId":"vndb:s80","sourcePerson